Rem AMOS Professional 2.00. Paste routines after End.
Hide
Palette $000,$FFF
Paper 0 : Pen 1
Cls 0
PL_COUNT=0 : PL_STEP=1 : PL_LASTSCAN=-1
Repeat
   Locate 0,0
   Print "A advances, X ignored, Q quits"
   Print "Count: ";PL_COUNT;"     "
   Gosub PL_READ_FRESH
   Gosub PL_ADVANCE
Until PL_KEY$="Q"
Show
End
